Os módulos exportam símbolos com nomes próprios em português, embora a interface pedida use `f01`–`f06`. Vou manter esses nomes na interface de `main.c` e associá-los aos símbolos existentes, sem alterar os módulos.
Created `main.c` with the requested headers, type definitions, `f01`–`f06` interface, and ordered calls. `main.c` compiles on its own.

The full build is blocked by `module_05.c`: `CURLUPART_USERNAME` is undeclared with the installed libcurl headers. Since the error is in a module and the instructions restrict fixes to `main.c`, I left the module unchanged. **The `output` binary was not produced.**
